{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"Nolan Reeve: 56/56 (-3)","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:19:57.348000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869826496448069632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Surely you know I'm on you now, Nidhogg. If you would, allow me stand by my companions. I was raised to believe that a good discussion requires eye contact.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:22:50.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869827220691120168","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"It is amazing how swallowing a foot can compel civility amongst mortals.\" He snickers.\n\"Very well. Join them. It matters little.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:23:56.322000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869827498777669674","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"I skid down his neck and wings to walk over to my friends.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:24:30.056000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869827640268292146","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Just to put it all on the table here.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:25:09.963000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869827807650402334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"He lowers his head to watch.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:25:58.659000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828011896234015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"I bring out two spears. \"One is my own, and the other the Allfather's. I show this because I mean no trickery. We are negotiating for what you're interested in.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:26:27.022000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828130859253862","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Mortals. You are exhausting.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:26:46.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828212279083018","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"What makes you think I want a toothpick?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:26:57.373000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828258160582696","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"He lowers his head.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:08.183000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828303501021234","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Its what the toothpick can unlock. The thing I thought only the All Father could give.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:28.968000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828390679621652","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I know you don't. I'm showing I have no intention of tricking you with a toothpick when I know you want Gungnir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:29.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828394664218624","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Oh?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:39.348000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828434216509482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Look around you, girl.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:51.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828484657213442","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Would you want to live here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:57.808000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828511643361302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"You wish to be bound elsewhere.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:27:58.029000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828512570290237","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Like the wolves.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:28:01.001000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828525035769927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"None who server under the reign of Odin would do so willingly.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:28:38.826000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828683685326848","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I sought to buy my freedom. Not a snack.\" He gestures to the roots.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:28:57.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828760155873330","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Are you implying Odin is a slaver?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:29:05.170000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869828794180067329","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Odin is above all selfish. He is a slaver when it suits him, and a breaker of chains when that means leads to his ends.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:29:39.402000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T06:30:39.661000Z","id":"869828937759473694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And my dear. The Gods of the Old World are at war.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:30:02.821000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T06:30:10.185000Z","id":"869829035985895455","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The war the wolves wish to escape,\" she considers to herself.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:31:39.888000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869829443114381322","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"and the ravens before them.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:31:54.238000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T06:31:59.186000Z","id":"869829503302643804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Do you want only freedom, Nidhogg? What do you intend to do with the world if you join it?\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:32:37.127000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869829683192156190","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Never lay eyes upon you or your people again.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:32:54.843000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T06:33:08.354000Z","id":"869829757498429520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The New World is crawling with my people, Nidhogg. If that's what you wish, you'd do best to avoid it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:34:06.530000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869830058175512606","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"What counts you as yours? I count those who know your name.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:35:31.007000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869830412497731614","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And they would know my name soon enough.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:36:02.516000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869830544656044063","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"“Those of our causes… our lands. The New World has our.. pe-ople.”","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:36:56.075000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869830769298792459","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The terms I suggest, but everyone is free to make changes to the contract before it is agreed on: if the key to your metaphorical chain is Gungnir, we will free you on the condition that you return the twin ravens to us, and we leave this place to its... frankly disgusting winter.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:39:59.557000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831538878054430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"And also maybe possibly, you swallow Odin.\" She adds, really quickly.","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:40:10.678000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831585522941962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Well, someone else can do that.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:40:27.474000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831655970459681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I just so happen to know a guy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:40:50.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831753961984060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"mazie","id":"366565198284324868","is_bot":0,"username":"damnzam"},"author_id":"366565198284324868","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"???\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:41:11.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831839370575893","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"The third wolf.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:41:18.326000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831869259198525","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"I will entreat only with the priestess. This is not a contract by commission.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:41:24.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869831896073388083","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"860203398771376198","content":"\"Your terms are acceptable.\"\n\"And if possible, I will swallow Odin.\"","created_at":"2021-07-28T06:42:07.292000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-28T06:42:15.969000Z","id":"869832074637475850","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
